  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDD - Mobilising Citizens for Credible 2024 Elections, Structural Reforms in the Governance Sector to Promote Election Integrity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to promote transparent, credible and peaceful elections 2024 through systematic election observation, reduce the negative influence of money in party and public elections as well as ensure promotion of accountability and corporate governance of State Owned Enterprises</narrative>
  </description>
